  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/999/690/spookybanner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"947\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需要 Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>這個模組新增了模仿《失憶症》或《絕命精神病院》等恐怖遊戲中門扉行為的驚悚款式門。這意味著你可以將門半開以窺視內部、受驚時猛力甩門關閉，同時享受吱呀作響的聲音交響曲。<strong>本模組不會更改原版門，而是新增需要手動放置的新款門扉</strong>。</p><h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3><ul>\n<li>拖曳滑鼠緩慢開啟門扉進行窺視</li>\n<li>快速拖曳滑鼠可猛力甩開或關閉門扉</li>\n<li>衝撞微開的門使其開啟或閉合</li>\n<li>操作時觸發驚悚的門扉音效</li>\n</ul><p>本模組為<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspooky-jam.com%252fevents%252f2024%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">2024驚悚遊戲創作活動</a>而製作。</p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/patreon-curseforge.png\"alt=\"Patreon 贊助支持\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspooky-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>",
